 US economy -- or other local, national, or multinational economic re~~
gion that forms the primary economic environment for this enterprise.~~
~
~
It includes:~
1. an annual long-run average growth rate, ~
2. a cyclic adjustment due to position in the economic cycle between ~~
boom and bust (top and bottom of economic growth rates), and~
3. a normally distributed year-to-year variability to represent unexp~~
lained variation around around the adjusted average.Author: Max HenrionDate: Tue, Feb 03, 2004 11:15 AMDefaultsize: 48,24Nodelocation: 88,384,1Nodesize: 56,28Diagstate: 1,530,57,398,352,17Windstate: 2,102,90,481,314Formnode Average_growth_rate1Title: Average growth rate of economyDefinition: 0Nodelocation: 184,44,1Nodesize: 177,11Nodeinfo: 1,0,0,1,0,0,0,72,0,1Original: Average_growth_rate_Formnode Economy_cycle_time1Title: Economy cycle timeDefinition: 0Nodelocation: 208,68,1Nodesize: 152,12Nodeinfo: 1,0,0,1,0,0,0,72,0,1Original: Period_of_economic_cFormnode Cycle_standard_devi1Title: Cycle standard deviation from averageDefinition: 0Nodelocation: 208,116,1Nodesize: 152,12Nodeinfo: 1,0,0,1,0,0,0,72,0,1Original: Amplitude_of_cycleFormnode Starting_cycle_posi1Title: Starting cycle positionDefinition: 0Nodelocation: 236,92,1Nodesize: 124,12Nodeinfo: 1,0,0,1,0,0,0,72,0,1Original: Starting_cycle_positFormnode Variability_in_econ1Title: Variability in economic growth from modelDefinition: 0Nodelocation: 184,140,1Nodesize: 176,11Nodeinfo: 1,0,0,1,0,0,0,72,0,1Original: Variability_in_growtFormnode Growth_rate_of_econ1Title: Growth rate of economyDefinition: 1Nodelocation: 187,229,1Nodesize: 165,13Nodeinfo: 1,0,0,1,0,0,0,72,0,1Original: Growth_rate_of_econoFormnode Position_in_economi1Title: Position in economic cycleDefinition: 1Nodelocation: 214,204,1Nodesize: 138,12Nodeinfo: 1,0,0,1,0,0,0,72,0,1Original: Cyclic_adjustmentText Te19Description: Inputs for cyclic model of economyNodelocation: 184,84,-1Nodesize: 176,76Nodeinfo: 1,0,0,1,1,1,1,,0,Nodefont: Arial Black, 15Text Te20Title: Te19Description: OutputsNodelocation: 184,208,-1Nodesize: 176,40Nodeinfo: 1,0,0,1,1,1,1,,0,Nodefont: Arial Black, 15Module Cyclic_economic_growTitle: Cyclic economic growth modelAuthor: MaxDate: Tue, Feb 03, 2004 11:15 AMDefaultsize: 48,24Nodelocation: 200,280,1Nodesize: 72,28Diagstate: 1,440,259,442,321,17V